[%-
  # ── Your library: change the values on these two lines only. ───────────────────────────────────────────
  library_name = branch.branchname;  # leave it like this to use the library name you have in Koha
  footer_note  = "";                 # one line under the signature, e.g. your opening hours; "" = none
  USE Koha;
  USE Price;
-%]
[%- fines_total = 0; FOREACH overdue IN overdues; fines_total = fines_total + overdue.overdue_fines.total_outstanding; END -%]
[% IF borrower.firstname %]Dear [% borrower.firstname %],[% ELSE %]Hello,[% END %]

Our records show that the items below are past their due date. Please return them or renew them if you can.
[% FOREACH overdue IN overdues %]
* [% overdue.item.biblio.title | $Remove_MARC_punctuation | trim %][% IF overdue.item.biblio.author %], [% overdue.item.biblio.author | $Remove_MARC_punctuation | trim %][% END %]
  Was due [% overdue.date_due | $KohaDates %] · Barcode [% overdue.item.barcode %][% IF overdue.overdue_fines.total_outstanding > 0 %] · Fine so far [% overdue.overdue_fines.total_outstanding | $Price with_symbol => 1 %][% END %]
[% END %]
[% IF fines_total > 0 -%]
Fines charged so far on these items: [% fines_total | $Price with_symbol => 1 %]

[% END -%]
[% IF borrower.is_debarred -%]
Your library account is restricted at the moment, so you may not be able to borrow or renew.

[% END -%]
If you have returned them already, thank you, and please ignore this notice.

[% IF branch.branchphone || branch.branchemail -%]
Questions? Contact us.[% IF branch.branchphone %] Phone: [% branch.branchphone %].[% END %][% IF branch.branchemail %] Email: [% branch.branchemail %].[% END %]

[% END -%]
[% IF Koha.Preference('OPACBaseURL') -%]
See your loans and renew them online: [% Koha.Preference('OPACBaseURL') %]/cgi-bin/koha/opac-user.pl

[% END -%]
Thank you,
[% library_name %]
[% IF footer_note %][% footer_note %][% END %]
